  "claim": "The leader of the band called Stiltskin and the main vocalist of VIXX ,that is also a member of the punk band VIXX LR, do not have the same nationality. She is the second album by the band called Stiltskin.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Ray Wilson (musician). Sentence: Raymond Wilson (born 8 September 1968) is a Scottish musician, best known as vocalist in the post-grunge band Stiltskin, and in Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\nPage: Leo (singer). Sentence: Jung Taek-woon (Hangul: 정택운 , born on November 10, 1990), better known by his stage name Leo (Hangul: 레오 ), is a South Korean singer, songwriter and musical theatre actor, signed under Jellyfish Entertainment.\nPage: VIXX LR. Sentence: Established in August 2015, VIXX LR consists of VIXX's main vocalist Leo and main rapper Ravi.\nPage: She (Stiltskin album). Sentence: She is the second album by the band Stiltskin now led by Ray Wilson.",
