        "original_id": "2fa36523-029d-5809-8a56-9a26887e7d3c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Wilson, Leo, Ravi\n- Bands and Music Projects: Stiltskin, Genesis, VIXX, VIXX LR\n- Companies: Jellyfish Entertainment\n- Products: She\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Wilson was born on 8 September 1968 and is a Scottish musician.\n- Leo, born Jung Taek-woon on 10 November 1990, is a South Korean singer, songwriter, and musical theatre actor.\n- Leo is signed under Jellyfish Entertainment.\n- Ray Wilson was a vocalist in Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\n- In August 2015, VIXX LR was established as a subunit of VIXX consisting of main vocalist Leo and main rapper Ravi.\n- Ray Wilson is best known as the vocalist in the post-grunge band Stiltskin.\n- She is the second album by Stiltskin, with the band led by Ray Wilson.",
